84
00:04:21,959 --> 00:04:25,565
And this month, we saw the
release of DeepSeek-R1 and Kimi

85
00:04:25,565 --> 00:04:27,110
k1.5.

86
00:04:27,110 --> 00:04:29,520
And also within the
same model series,

87
00:04:29,520 --> 00:04:31,430
