drastic improvement

88
00:04:31,430 --> 00:04:33,360
from different
versions of the model.

89
00:04:33,360 --> 00:04:36,890
So, for example, there is a
rapid progress of performance

90
00:04:36,890 --> 00:04:38,760
for OpenAI o1 to o3.

91
00:04:38,760 --> 00:04:41,810
And also if we compare the
current Gemini Thinking model

92
00:04:41,810 --> 00:04:44,310
