103
00:05:16,600 --> 00:05:20,070
it shows that it can
be ranked among top 200

104
00:05:20,070 --> 00:05:23,370
among the human participants
on Codeforces Competitive

105
00:05:23,370 --> 00:05:25,560
Programming contest.

106
00:05:25,560 --> 00:05:28,090
If we think about
these milestones,

107
00:05:28,090 --> 00:05:31,590
probably they are even very hard
to imagine a couple of months

108
00:05:31,590 --> 00:05:33,190
ago before they
actually happened.

